  "readCoverage": "Read complete32,840-byte v1 reader and8,050-byte v1 collector, then every exact v1-to-v2 source change and the complete v2 authority. No template, candidate, product, test or syntax execution.",
  "sourceReview": [
    "Both templates reject unbound run/head identities before API or file operations. Exact-run versions require a further identity/reader-source pin review before first use.",
    "Collector is limited to read-only GitHub Actions endpoints, authenticates exact workflow/branch/push/run-attempt/head and two distinct explicit job IDs/roles, requires complete API total_count and distinct finite/browser artifact roles, and retains raw completed API/job logs/outerZIPs.",
    "API artifact digest and size authenticate the local outerZIP. An approved reader source hash is checked before invocation. Existing original files are not overwritten; collection observations and v2 outputs preserve earlier versions.",
    "Reader handles the portable outer and inner ZIPs with path, link, duplicate, count and byte bounds; reads every member through ZIP CRC and checks exact local byte readback. Incomplete evidence cannot certify acceptance.",
    "The exact60-source composed proof and56-source baseline proof authenticate bundle, after-images, before-images, authority/peer, historical originals, shared host and workflow as data. All32 baseline source names and every expected source Git blob are independently matched to the exact boundHEAD.",
    "Full six-directory eligible names are now closed against the exactHEAD tree using the helper's six roots, file extensions, node_modules/.local/results exclusions and three top-level files. After census adds precisely four reviewed test paths and contains all six eligible overlay paths.",
    "Current36 Notes/6eligible overlays and every other eligible Git blob, exact source snapshots, composition receipts and independent always composer postcheck are verified. Fixed12 tooling literals and separately Git-bound collector self are authenticated without importing them.",
    "Finite raw TAP requires111 passed groups, zero failure/cancel/skip/todo, exact21-file selection,23 old plus19 new names once, and exact observed child invocation equal to the fixed attempt command. Original20/4/2 comparisons remain separate and explicitly limited.",
    "Browser verifies exact8 titles/report outcomes, one real browser worker, source36 pins, all eight final records/CRC PNGs/complete cleanups, three success plus one failure holds, genuine empty-title400 and two restored synthetic-I/O list400 responses.",
    "Fault evidence requires exact step ordering through request/attachment drain, real host400, safe empty-directory removal, original byte restoration and only then original response delivery. Native downloads retain exact JEX/resource bytes, and independent Python TAR data reads compare all seven prior raw records plus resource.",
    "Acquisition execution comparison removes only the explicitly declared GITHUB_JOB boundary. Separate browser postcheck binds the same attempt, composition, tooling and independent composer postcheck.",
    "Failures remain readable with recordedContractPassed false and consistency errors. Combined success now additionally requires actual terminal run and both job success conclusions. No product code, test, browser, build or original is invoked by these backup tools."
  ],
